        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova, Nkaambo kamilandu yotatwe yaMoabu, ee ncobeni yone, nsikooyoobapilusizya luumo. Nkaambo zifuwa zyamwami wa-Edomu wakazitenta, zyaba mulambo. ",
