          "text": "Balalyata mutwe wamucete kulusuko lwanyika, ayalo inzila yabaubaansidwe balaileesya, alimwi mwaalumi awisi balanjila mubuvuule amusimbi omwe, aboobo balasampaula izina lyangu lisalala. ",
