        {
          "text": "Pele mebo ndakabanyonyweeda ba-Amori kuzwa kubusyu bwabo. Bulamfu bwabaabo bwakali mbuli bulamfu bwamukamba, alimwi wakali singuzu mbuli mubanga, nekubaboobo ndakanyonyoona micelo yabo yakujulu amiyanda yabo yakunsi. ",
